                                "sense_id": "c30e3cfd-5101-36a6-8e25-9215528c2b21",
                                "text": "These other germs are the cause of colds and coughs and grippes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc8c3033-d515-45c7-812b-993cbd9b9f56",
                                "sense_id": "c30e3cfd-5101-36a6-8e25-9215528c2b21",
                                "text": "\"Mid-Lent, and the Enemy grins,\" remarked Selwyn as he started for church with Nina and the children. Austin, knee-deep in a dozen Sunday supplements, refused to stir; poor little Eileen was now convalescent from grippe, but still unsteady on her legs; her maid had taken the grippe, and now moaned all day: \"Mon dieu! Mon dieu! Che fais mourir!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
